## SQ-GAP-01 | jams: one jar per Cooking Pot jam, 400-tick Cooking Pot jams, jars stack to 64
@group A (full pack)
@commands jams (TODO `dishes/jams #9`, changelog Jams): `/cdevtest rdetail` on every recipe id that matches `vintagedelight:*jam*` and `fruitsdelight:*jam*` (`/cdevtest recipes` filter, or grep `kubejs/exported/` recipe dump); read output count, cook time
@pass every Vintage Delight jam jar Cooking Pot recipe (10 on 2026-11-23, incl. `creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/*`) outputs 1 item and cooks 400 ticks; Fruits Delight jams are `create:mixing` (`fruitsdelight:mixing/flowing_*_jam`), not Cooking Pot recipes; the jam jar items stack to 64 (`/cdevtest item vintagedelight:cherry_jam_jar` or the item dump `maxStackSize`)
@fails `jams.js`, jar JSONs in the Delight jar, stack-size policy script
@reviewed 2026-11-23
@from batches/r1113/c4_a.qb
> cdevtest rdetail jam_jar max=400
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail text=jam_jar n= 30
count \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail id=\S+ serializer=farmersdelight:cooking result=vintagedelight:\S*jam_jar\*1 >= 10
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail id=\S+ serializer=farmersdelight:cooking result=vintagedelight:\S*jam_jar\*([2-9]|\d\d+)
> zc4 cooktime jam
waitlog \[zc4\] done 30
> cdevtest item vintagedelight:cherry_jam_jar
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=item item=vintagedelight:cherry_jam_jar .*max_stack=64
look every jam jar cook line in the zc4 output has time=400 (10 recipes); no Fruits Delight jam is listed there (they are create:mixing)
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0

